{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36476","headline":"览陈丕卷 · 罗邺","name":"览陈丕卷","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪宫词客燕宫游，一轴烟花象外搜。\n谩把蜀纹当昼展，徒夸湘碧带春流。\n吟时致我寒侵骨，得处疑君白尽头。\n从北南归明月夜，岭猨滩鸟更悠悠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36476.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36476","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}